@claim q/g68e71dc92ff0-6-1 { status: inferred, grounds: [d/g68e71dc92ff0-6], "code:kind": anticipated, "ingest:quote": "Decisions are the reliable kind; the systems differ in recall, not correctness. **Prerequisites are the weak kind** — the system that finds most of them is right 41% of the time, and the one that is right 88% of the time finds a fifth. Alternatives have the worst precision of the three." }
